# Six salts, six flame observations
#
# Each dry salt carries a reviewed flame colour. This is a virtual flame test:
# never taste salts or put household substances into a real flame. Lithium is
# absent from the current registry and is not silently substituted.
register lv1
add v1 NaCl 1g
ignite v1
new crucible
add v2 KCl 1g
ignite v2
new crucible
add v3 CaCl2 1g
ignite v3
new crucible
add v4 Sr+2 0.01mol
ignite v4
new crucible
add v5 BaCl2 1g
ignite v5
new crucible
add v6 Cu+2 0.01mol
ignite v6
